                                                "sense_id": "f43fd41d-c8cd-30a1-9077-66b7e6789c5d",
                                                "text": "Some researchers think that the warming was caused as kimberlite pipes (volcanic vents originating deep in the Earth’s mantle) reached the surface near Lac de Gras in northern Canada and released huge amounts of carbon."
                                            }
